{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1496719-homebrew-primordial-shards-beast-magic-items","id":1496719,"title":"[Homebrew] Primordial Shards - Beast Magic Items","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-11-10T11:40:05-08:00","id":1496719,"title":"[Homebrew] Primordial Shards - Beast Magic Items","content":"These are items with \u201cshards\u201d of the Primordial Dream and the Horrors that help implant it inside of the object. They appear to be normal items from the mortal world, but to other Beasts or when brought to the Primordial Dream, their horrific form is revealed. A computer used in cyberbullying has a flesh-like pulse to it. A knife used to kill victims mutters and begs for blood. A pair of shoes used to run down their prey have insectoid wings on their heels. The tools of monsters are here\u2026 and they\u2019re hungry.<br /> <br /> <b>Creation:</b><br /> When a Beast uses an item in a significant way in a shock, a Beast can, instead of feeding, spend a Satiety to infuse an item with Satiety instead of their Horror. This must happen either in the Primordial Dream or in the presence of a Lair trait.<br /> Each 5 Satiety absorbed (including the one spent) increases the dot rating of the Shard by one.<br /> <br /> <b>Powers:</b><br /> For each dot of its rating, the item gains one of the following benefits:<br /> <br /> Extraordinary: an appropriate +1 equipment bonus, armor rating, or weapon damage modifier. This can be taken more than once.<br /> Alacrity: +2 to Initiative and Speed. This can be taken more than once.<br /> Battery: Can absorb and store 1 point of Satiety. This can be taken more than once.<br /> Durable: +2 Durability.<br /> Efficient: 9-Again; can be taken again for 8-Again.<br /> Bonded: The item only works for one particular owner, or type of person. Any other person attempting to wield it gains the Cursed condition.<br /> <br /> <b>Drawbacks:</b><br /> Phobia: The user gains a negative condition based on the shocks absorbed into the item while wielding it. Beasts are immune to the Phobia.<br /> Tracking: Any Hero who gets their hands on the item gains the dot rating as a bonus to track the creator, or the last user.<br /> <br /> <b>Other Features:</b><br /> When a Beast increases the dot rating of a Shard, it gains a Crux, a key emotion from the shock(s) symbolic in its creation (to a maximum of one). When the Crux is used in resonance against a target who feels said emotion, the Shard flares, feeling the pull of the Primordial Dream. Mechanically, this grants the user exceptional successes on three instead of five on mundane rolls against the target. However, Beasts also extend this benefit to Nightmares.<br /> <br /> <b>Merits:</b><br /> <br /> <b>Shard Attuner (\u2022\u2022)</b><br /> Prerequisite: Beast<br /> When opening a Primordial Pathway, the Beast may add the Shard\u2019s rating to the roll. If the Beast has multiple Shards, take the highest rating one.<br /> <br /> <b>Primordial Shard (\u2022 to \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)</b><br /> You have an item infused with the Primordial Dream with a dot rating equal to this merit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Proud creator of <b><a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/420206/Curiouser-and-Curiouser-Bargains\" target=\"_blank\">Curiouser and Curiouser Bargains</a></b>, a collection of 30+ Homebrew Contracts and 10+ Entitlements on the STV!<br /> My <b><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1GFE19F9st7dhGh9zv_hEQyOSm80Xp7dQwmvFg2SAXJY/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules</a></b> for Changeling!<br /> My <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/17SsOsKpfdANVZscFHSO_afTx-gD3h0iX3p5q07V4u50/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><b>House Rules</b></a> for Vampire!<br /> My <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kR6ASTLjaEDwl3zgANnkRrbk0-s2bvw40uXwS-q15O0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><b>House Rules</b></a> for Geist!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27667-super-vlad","name":"Super Vlad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27667_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T11:50:38-08:00","id":1496722,"title":"","content":"<i>Example: John has decided to make a Primordial Shard. Over the course of two feedings, he infuses a coffee cup that his victims slowly realize that they've been poisoned from. He reaches the first threshold.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Poisoner's Cup (\u2022)<br /> Crux:</b> Denial <i>&quot;No. Nonononononono, I'm not dying this way to my own goddamn employee-&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <b>Effect:</b> +2 Durability.<br /> <b>Phobia:</b> Gain the Unaware condition.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> <i>Example: Veronica has decided to make a Primordial Shard. Over the course of several feedings, she infuses spear that pierces through the guilty she has hunted down and killed.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Judgement's Spear (\u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> Crux:</b> Repentance <i>\u201dI\u2019m sorry, I\u2019m sorry! I swear to God, I didn\u2019t mean to hit her, I-\u201c</i><br /> <br /> <b>Effect:</b> +2L, 9-again<br /> <b>Phobia:</b> Gain the Guilty condition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Proud creator of <b><a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/420206/Curiouser-and-Curiouser-Bargains\" target=\"_blank\">Curiouser and Curiouser Bargains</a></b>, a collection of 30+ Homebrew Contracts and 10+ Entitlements on the STV!<br /> My <b><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1GFE19F9st7dhGh9zv_hEQyOSm80Xp7dQwmvFg2SAXJY/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules</a></b> for Changeling!<br /> My <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/17SsOsKpfdANVZscFHSO_afTx-gD3h0iX3p5q07V4u50/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><b>House Rules</b></a> for Vampire!<br /> My <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kR6ASTLjaEDwl3zgANnkRrbk0-s2bvw40uXwS-q15O0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><b>House Rules</b></a> for Geist!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27667-super-vlad","name":"Super Vlad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27667_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T16:33:40-08:00","id":1496757,"title":"","content":"Oh, neat! I\u2019ve thought Beast needed something in this vein for a while. This seems both reasonable, and simple. I\u2019ve one question though: how does the bonded upgrade work if the object used for the shard is a painting or some other object that is primarily used for viewing? Does it curse everyone who looks at it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-16T06:54:35-08:00","id":1497279,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar26736_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26736\" data-vbnamecard=\"26736\">TempleBuilder</a> <br /> <br /> I interpret it as this: as long as you're technically still the owner and not someone else stealing it, you don't get the Cursed condition. So: if you gave permission for people to view it in a public art gallery, they'd be fine. However, if someone stole it and hung it up in their home, they'd get the Cursed condition.<br /> <br /> <b>Painting of a Butcher's Masterpiece (\u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> Crux:</b> Morfitied <i>&quot;It's... daring. By God, I hate even looking at it, but I just can't look away.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <b>Effect:</b> Battery x3<br /> <b>Phobia:</b> Gain the Persistent Spooked condition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Proud creator of <b><a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/420206/Curiouser-and-Curiouser-Bargains\" target=\"_blank\">Curiouser and Curiouser Bargains</a></b>, a collection of 30+ Homebrew Contracts and 10+ Entitlements on the STV!<br /> My <b><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1GFE19F9st7dhGh9zv_hEQyOSm80Xp7dQwmvFg2SAXJY/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules</a></b> for Changeling!<br /> My <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/17SsOsKpfdANVZscFHSO_afTx-gD3h0iX3p5q07V4u50/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><b>House Rules</b></a> for Vampire!<br /> My <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kR6ASTLjaEDwl3zgANnkRrbk0-s2bvw40uXwS-q15O0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><b>House Rules</b></a> for Geist!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""}